1
00:00:04,130 --> 00:00:07,695
Now I've taken weakness as my ally

2
00:00:07,696 --> 00:00:11,347
I can fly to the highest heights

3
00:00:11,347 --> 00:00:14,130
If I would just stop here

4
00:00:14,130 --> 00:00:18,782
all I've lost would lose its luster

5
00:00:18,782 --> 00:00:22,304
If you were lost out somewhere

6
00:00:22,304 --> 00:00:25,912
at the same time my heart is shaken

7
00:00:25,913 --> 00:00:28,782
Id have no way to find you

8
00:00:28,782 --> 00:00:32,826
your kindness, or even your strength

9
00:00:32,826 --> 00:00:38,521
I know

10
00:00:38,521 --> 00:00:40,391
It's time for the dawn!

11
00:00:40,478 --> 00:00:43,782
My peak performance

12
00:00:43,869 --> 00:00:47,826
blow straight past in a blast, yeah

13
00:00:47,826 --> 00:00:50,608
You'll be left frozen with laughs

14
00:00:50,608 --> 00:00:55,043
The days of pain left in the past, let's hope

15
00:00:55,043 --> 00:00:57,869
As Imake foes of the world

16
00:00:57,869 --> 00:01:02,304
Em bracing myself upon shaking legs, yeah I'm

17
00:01:02,304 --> 00:01:05,043
Just keep me going for a few more steps

18
00:01:05,043 --> 00:01:09,912
Now, this is the comeback, the time to awaken is now

19
00:01:19,521 --> 00:01:24,478
Now, this is the comeback, the time to awaken is now

20
00:02:15,826 --> 00:02:21,043
Battle on the rooftop of the Skull Dome, Onigashima,
in the skies above the Land of Wano.

21
00:02:21,043 --> 00:02:24,521
The victor: Kaido.
Or, so he was...

22
00:02:26,391 --> 00:02:27,826
Luffy!

23
00:02:32,652 --> 00:02:34,130
Whoa, there...

24
00:02:45,652 --> 00:02:49,304
All of you were incredible!
Truly unbelievable!

25
00:02:49,696 --> 00:02:53,217
I am so overjoyed!

26
00:02:59,391 --> 00:03:04,174
Been ages since I seen 'em, meow!
Them's those sky boat lanterns, ain't?

27
00:03:04,217 --> 00:03:05,130
Oopsie...

28
00:03:07,608 --> 00:03:09,956
Ain't no lie, yous-gara!

29
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:13,913
Luffy, by his own strength,
sent Kaido plummetin' into the bowels of the earth!

30
00:03:14,347 --> 00:03:21,043
And, Momonosuke-sama turned inta a giant dragon
n' stopped Onigashima's descent!

31
00:03:21,869 --> 00:03:23,478
Did I get all that right?

32
00:03:23,478 --> 00:03:24,478
Indeed!

33
00:03:26,304 --> 00:03:30,738
You're saying that pink dragon
was Momonosuke-sama?!

34
00:03:30,739 --> 00:03:32,043
He's a Devil Fruit user?

35
00:03:34,739 --> 00:03:36,913
It's been twenty years
since that day...

36
00:03:39,347 --> 00:03:45,304
Since Oden-sama's tragic death,
since the start of our war t' avenge 'im...

37
00:03:48,347 --> 00:03:51,912
An' now, we've finally won!

38
00:03:54,347 --> 00:03:57,521
We took down two
Emperors of the Sea!

39
00:03:57,608 --> 00:04:01,912
I didn't think I'd make it out alive!

40
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:04,870
Purrrrmeow mrrowmeow!

41
00:04:11,696 --> 00:04:13,261
Meeeow!

42
00:04:42,260 --> 00:04:44,651
Feels great, hunting the big game, huh?

43
00:04:47,957 --> 00:04:50,087
Well, I ain't happy about it.

44
00:04:55,435 --> 00:04:58,825
Captain...

45
00:04:59,696 --> 00:05:00,609
Cap...

46
00:05:01,608 --> 00:05:02,608
Cap...

47
00:05:02,608 --> 00:05:05,478
Captain!

48
00:05:07,086 --> 00:05:09,608
Hey...
No clinging!

49
00:05:10,260 --> 00:05:14,043
Straw Hat took down Kaido?!

50
00:05:15,782 --> 00:05:17,565
He did it...

51
00:05:17,565 --> 00:05:20,521
Luffy won!

52
00:05:21,478 --> 00:05:25,304
Ya did it, Big Bro!

53
00:05:25,957 --> 00:05:28,391
Yippee! Yahoo!

54
00:05:28,391 --> 00:05:29,608
Luffy won!

55
00:05:29,608 --> 00:05:31,825
Big Bro!

56
00:05:42,174 --> 00:05:46,086
Everybody around me, going off
and pushing themselves to their limits...

57
00:05:46,086 --> 00:05:47,782
Chopper!

58
00:05:47,869 --> 00:05:49,652
Two seriously injured
people, incoming!

59
00:05:50,347 --> 00:05:53,912
Chopper! Zoro isn't waking up!

60
00:05:53,913 --> 00:05:56,608
Dr. Chopper! Please come here!

61
00:05:56,608 --> 00:05:57,521
Aye...

62
00:05:57,521 --> 00:06:00,173
Dr. Chopper!
We need you here, too!

63
00:06:00,174 --> 00:06:03,913
Dr. Chopper!
The wound reopened!

64
00:06:03,913 --> 00:06:04,435
Doctor!

65
00:06:04,435 --> 00:06:05,739
Dr. Chopper!

66
00:06:05,739 --> 00:06:06,869
Doctor!

67
00:06:07,608 --> 00:06:10,738
Miyagi!
There's too many critical patients!

68
00:06:10,739 --> 00:06:13,913
Okay! Let's take care of them!

69
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:18,261
We scoured the castle
for medicine and medical equipment!

70
00:06:23,043 --> 00:06:24,782
Meanwhile, in the capital,

71
00:06:25,391 --> 00:06:29,130
the lively festival is coming to a close...

72
00:06:34,869 --> 00:06:37,043
Steady as she gooooes!

73
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:45,870
Say, Tengu-san!

74
00:06:48,086 --> 00:06:49,782
What is it, O-Toko?

75
00:06:50,608 --> 00:06:54,260
I heard my dad was
a super important guy!

76
00:06:56,217 --> 00:07:00,304
And he knew he'd
get killed if he got caught!

77
00:07:01,739 --> 00:07:06,087
But somebody said he went 'n
got himself caught on purpose!

78
00:07:07,043 --> 00:07:08,564
I wonder why...

79
00:07:10,652 --> 00:07:11,739
That is because...

80
00:07:16,086 --> 00:07:20,738
Yasuie-dono gave
this country a fighting chance,

81
00:07:22,696 --> 00:07:25,043
Had he not done...

82
00:07:30,260 --> 00:07:32,782
...what he did that day,

83
00:07:32,782 --> 00:07:39,260
all the lanterns of hope we had lit to that point
would have been extinguished...

84
00:07:41,086 --> 00:07:43,608
Cover your children's eyes!

85
00:07:43,608 --> 00:07:46,869
The last Daimyo to serve under Kozuki...

86
00:07:46,869 --> 00:07:50,739
No, no... Ebisu Town's
happy-go-lucky guy...

87
00:07:50,739 --> 00:07:53,043
...will be crossing over to the other side!

88
00:08:01,608 --> 00:08:07,825
He sacrificed his life for the sake of
protecting the future of the Land of Wano.

89
00:08:07,826 --> 00:08:13,782
So that you may live happily in the future
he and the others have guaranteed.

90
00:08:14,782 --> 00:08:16,391
He did it for me...

91
00:08:27,521 --> 00:08:30,043
Toko! Toko!

92
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:32,565
Toko!

93
00:08:35,174 --> 00:08:36,130
Don't tell me...

94
00:08:36,130 --> 00:08:38,565
...you ate the fruit!

95
00:08:38,565 --> 00:08:41,130
I toldja not to eat that...

96
00:08:47,174 --> 00:08:49,434
I-I'm sorry...

97
00:08:53,260 --> 00:08:54,434
Toko...

98
00:09:03,652 --> 00:09:05,739
Mind if Daddy has some?

99
00:09:05,739 --> 00:09:06,826
Huh?!

100
00:09:08,435 --> 00:09:10,174
You're quite a dancer!

101
00:09:10,174 --> 00:09:13,782
You'll be the best dancer
in all of Wano someday!

102
00:09:13,782 --> 00:09:14,869
Ya think so?!

103
00:09:25,521 --> 00:09:26,825
Daddy...

104
00:09:27,347 --> 00:09:30,956
For me? To live happily?

105
00:09:30,957 --> 00:09:32,347
Tis what I believe.

106
00:09:32,347 --> 00:09:34,130
Then I'mma...

107
00:09:34,130 --> 00:09:36,000
...change my message!

108
00:09:43,130 --> 00:09:44,956
This look good?

109
00:09:47,130 --> 00:09:48,217
Aye...

110
00:09:50,957 --> 00:09:52,739
'Tis much better...

111
00:09:53,174 --> 00:09:54,913
Indeed....

112
00:09:54,913 --> 00:09:57,391
There is...

113
00:09:58,174 --> 00:10:02,521
...no higher honor for a samurai.

114
00:10:21,086 --> 00:10:24,173
Steady as she gooooes!

115
00:10:32,826 --> 00:10:34,217
Zunesha...

116
00:10:36,869 --> 00:10:39,652
Zunesha, do you hear me?

117
00:10:40,217 --> 00:10:42,869
I have given much thought to it...

118
00:10:43,957 --> 00:10:45,522
I will not...

119
00:10:46,043 --> 00:10:48,216
...open our borders, yet.

120
00:10:49,739 --> 00:10:51,174
Understood.

121
00:10:51,826 --> 00:10:55,347
I defer to your decision.

122
00:10:55,347 --> 00:10:57,999
I have no reason to distrust you.

123
00:10:58,000 --> 00:11:00,261
Mmm. Thank you.

124
00:11:07,608 --> 00:11:09,521
Don't celebrate yet!

125
00:11:09,521 --> 00:11:12,478
We still outnumber you!

126
00:11:12,478 --> 00:11:14,347
You snooze, you lose!

127
00:11:14,347 --> 00:11:15,782
Just give up!

128
00:11:15,869 --> 00:11:20,782
There's no way Kaido-san could lose!
We're an Emperor of the Sea's crew!

129
00:11:21,347 --> 00:11:24,347
Damn, they don't know when to give up...

130
00:11:24,347 --> 00:11:26,651
You wanna go, huh?!

131
00:11:26,652 --> 00:11:30,043
I still got plenty left in the tank!

132
00:11:30,086 --> 00:11:31,782
Wait, Franky-san!

133
00:11:31,869 --> 00:11:34,086
Shaddap!

134
00:11:34,086 --> 00:11:36,564
Stop this at once,
Animal Kingdom Pirates!

135
00:11:39,608 --> 00:11:41,608
You still do not understand?

136
00:11:41,608 --> 00:11:43,912
Your lives were forfeit!

137
00:11:45,174 --> 00:11:46,869
Young Master Yamato...

138
00:11:46,869 --> 00:11:52,043
The one who stopped Onigashima from falling
after Kaido's Flame Clouds had vanished...

139
00:11:52,043 --> 00:11:53,434
...was our very own...

140
00:11:53,435 --> 00:11:56,260
...Commander-in-chief
Kozuki Momonosuke!

141
00:11:56,260 --> 00:11:58,521
Whose side was he on?!

142
00:11:58,521 --> 00:12:01,782
You have lost the battle
and your lives were spared...

143
00:12:01,782 --> 00:12:04,956
But if you press your attack...

144
00:12:05,739 --> 00:12:08,391
I will cleanse this world
of you thoroughly!

145
00:12:12,957 --> 00:12:15,130
What is this tremor?

146
00:12:19,869 --> 00:12:22,217
What is it? An earthquake?!

147
00:12:40,478 --> 00:12:42,695
What's going on?

148
00:12:42,696 --> 00:12:44,086
Babanuki-san!

149
00:12:44,086 --> 00:12:45,390
What now?!

150
00:12:45,391 --> 00:12:47,521
S-Something's wrong
on the sea surface!

151
00:12:47,521 --> 00:12:48,521
Show me!

152
00:12:48,608 --> 00:12:49,738
Yes, sir!

153
00:12:52,521 --> 00:12:54,608
Why is this happening?!

154
00:12:54,608 --> 00:12:57,738
The lot of you! Don't just stand there!
Go check on it!

155
00:13:23,869 --> 00:13:25,826
Whaaaaaa?!

156
00:13:25,826 --> 00:13:29,130
An undersea volcano erupted?!

157
00:13:32,782 --> 00:13:34,956
The Battle in the Skies
over the Land of Wano...

158
00:13:34,957 --> 00:13:37,913
Former Victor: Kaido.

159
00:13:37,913 --> 00:13:39,783
The New Victor:
Straw Hat Luffy!

160
00:13:47,739 --> 00:13:48,696
An eruption?!

161
00:13:48,696 --> 00:13:50,391
That's coming from Udon!

162
00:13:50,391 --> 00:13:52,391
What was that jolt?!

163
00:13:52,391 --> 00:13:54,869
Are Kaido and his ilk
up to something?!

164
00:13:56,130 --> 00:13:58,260
Something's flying this way!

165
00:14:02,043 --> 00:14:03,434
No need to worry!

166
00:14:03,435 --> 00:14:05,869
This is not a crisis!

167
00:14:10,260 --> 00:14:13,130
K-Kaido... sama!

168
00:14:13,130 --> 00:14:14,608
Why is he here?!

169
00:14:14,608 --> 00:14:17,651
Today is supposed to be
our one free day!

170
00:14:20,957 --> 00:14:22,478
My loyal subjects!

171
00:14:22,478 --> 00:14:24,478
I am not Kaido!

172
00:14:25,478 --> 00:14:26,565
Eh?!

173
00:14:26,565 --> 00:14:28,391
The war is over!

174
00:14:29,043 --> 00:14:30,782
That eruption was...

175
00:14:30,782 --> 00:14:32,956
...the final beat of the drum, signaling...

176
00:14:32,957 --> 00:14:36,087
...the end of Kaido, Supreme Commander
of the Animal Kingdom Pirates!

177
00:14:46,347 --> 00:14:47,956
Where did the dragon go?!

178
00:14:48,521 --> 00:14:50,478
H-Hey, look!

179
00:14:55,826 --> 00:14:56,912
There's people...

180
00:14:58,565 --> 00:15:00,086
How many are there?

181
00:15:20,608 --> 00:15:23,608
Huuuh?!
Komurasaki-sama?!

182
00:15:23,608 --> 00:15:27,738
That can't be! Is she a ghost?!
We just held her funeral!

183
00:15:28,217 --> 00:15:30,304
Is this for real?!
Or am I just dreaming?!

184
00:15:30,304 --> 00:15:32,738
She is real! Real beautiful!

185
00:15:36,521 --> 00:15:38,173
Boss Kyoshiro!

186
00:15:39,217 --> 00:15:41,260
What happened to your
special pompadour?

187
00:15:44,739 --> 00:15:45,174
And now...

188
00:15:46,174 --> 00:15:48,217
'Tis a long tale...

189
00:15:50,391 --> 00:15:51,826
...but we present to you...

190
00:15:51,826 --> 00:15:54,739
the new Shogun
of the Land of Wano!

191
00:15:55,217 --> 00:15:58,304
How is it possible?

192
00:15:59,739 --> 00:16:01,565
Run!

193
00:16:05,696 --> 00:16:07,913
No... It's not...

194
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:10,130
Stop!

195
00:16:12,826 --> 00:16:14,782
There is no need to flee...

196
00:16:14,782 --> 00:16:17,391
That dragon...
I do not believe it was Kaido!

197
00:16:17,957 --> 00:16:19,913
Does that mean... a second dragon?!

198
00:16:23,130 --> 00:16:24,826
Boss Kyoshiro!

199
00:16:25,869 --> 00:16:27,304
Komurasaki-sama?!

200
00:16:27,304 --> 00:16:29,521
How can she be here?!

201
00:16:31,347 --> 00:16:34,086
What is happening at
the front of the palace?!

202
00:16:34,086 --> 00:16:37,173
Please explain, Boss Kyoshiro!

203
00:16:37,739 --> 00:16:39,782
Naturally, the two of you
are quite famous.

204
00:16:40,521 --> 00:16:45,521
But I wonder, does anybody still recall us?

205
00:16:54,739 --> 00:16:56,565
K-K-Kin!

206
00:17:04,000 --> 00:17:06,217
VK-Kin'emon-dono!

207
00:17:06,217 --> 00:17:08,304
Foxfire Kin'emon?!

208
00:17:08,304 --> 00:17:10,347
>How?! Was he not long dead?!

209
00:17:11,217 --> 00:17:14,043
Did he not perish
in the flames of the Oden Castle?!

210
00:17:14,043 --> 00:17:17,260
What is he doing here?!
Is this truly all a mere dream?!

211
00:17:21,565 --> 00:17:23,869
Have we crossed into
the Land of the Dead?

212
00:17:23,869 --> 00:17:26,304
But when did we dies!

213
00:17:26,608 --> 00:17:29,173
No! Who cares if it's a dream?

214
00:17:29,565 --> 00:17:33,130
Anybody else feel like
something monumental is about to occur?!

215
00:17:34,086 --> 00:17:35,173
Yokozuna!

216
00:17:40,565 --> 00:17:42,565
Kawamatsu-sama, the Kappa!

217
00:17:45,696 --> 00:17:47,174
Inuarashi-dono!

218
00:17:50,826 --> 00:17:52,304
Even Raizo of the Mist?!

219
00:17:53,869 --> 00:17:55,304
Nekomamushi-dono, and...

220
00:17:55,304 --> 00:17:56,217
Ooh!

221
00:17:56,217 --> 00:17:59,087
Kikunojo-sama of the Fallen Snow!

222
00:18:00,739 --> 00:18:03,087
Boss Kyoshiro, what is the meaning of this?!

223
00:18:03,826 --> 00:18:08,652
"Napping Kyoshiro" was naught but an alias I assumed
to evade the prying eyes of the world.

224
00:18:08,652 --> 00:18:11,391
In actuality, I am...

225
00:18:11,391 --> 00:18:14,826
Denjiro of the Nine Red Scabbards!

226
00:18:19,478 --> 00:18:22,478
The Nine Red Scabbards!
It really is them, in the flesh!

227
00:18:22,478 --> 00:18:23,869
They still lived!

228
00:18:23,869 --> 00:18:25,826
The Red Scabbards have returned!

229
00:18:31,043 --> 00:18:34,260
Did they not all perish twenty years ago?!

230
00:18:34,260 --> 00:18:37,695
Toki-sama spoke the truth!

231
00:18:52,826 --> 00:18:55,086
This is unfathomable!

232
00:18:55,086 --> 00:18:57,390
Somebody! Prepare a Light Scroll!

233
00:18:57,869 --> 00:19:01,260
Make haste!
All of Wano must know this!

234
00:19:01,869 --> 00:19:03,782
A transmission from the capital!

235
00:19:03,782 --> 00:19:05,347
One and all, to Bakura Town!

236
00:19:08,521 --> 00:19:10,347
News from the capital!
What could have happened?!

237
00:19:10,347 --> 00:19:12,477
Is this about the earthquake just now?

238
00:19:12,478 --> 00:19:14,956
I was afraid the whole village
would collapse!

239
00:19:20,435 --> 00:19:22,826
Hey! We've got bigger worries
than some broadcast!

240
00:19:24,869 --> 00:19:27,304
What? What? What happened?

241
00:19:30,608 --> 00:19:31,956
What is it?!

242
00:19:31,957 --> 00:19:34,521
Communications
from the Flower Capital!

243
00:19:34,521 --> 00:19:36,173
Project the Light Scroll!

244
00:19:40,608 --> 00:19:42,086
What?!

245
00:19:42,086 --> 00:19:44,521
Kaido's son?!

246
00:19:44,565 --> 00:19:45,738
Yes! Pleased to meet you!

247
00:19:48,174 --> 00:19:49,739
You wanna fight?!

248
00:19:49,739 --> 00:19:52,217
D-D-Don't struggle!
You waste your time!

249
00:19:53,130 --> 00:19:57,086
Does that mean...
Our battle is still not won?!

250
00:19:57,086 --> 00:20:01,086
Nay, most certainly not!
I am not your foe!

251
00:20:01,086 --> 00:20:04,390
have followed your exploits
in the news for so long!

252
00:20:04,826 --> 00:20:08,739
I admit, there were many of you
whom I doubted were even human...

253
00:20:09,217 --> 00:20:10,434
But now that I see you
in the flesh...

254
00:20:10,478 --> 00:20:11,652
Uh, what about your horns?!

255
00:20:14,957 --> 00:20:17,000
Did you say Kaido's son?!

256
00:20:17,000 --> 00:20:20,739
Nami-swannn! Your savior is coming!

257
00:20:20,739 --> 00:20:24,869
At any rate, I will be joining you
on your vessel!

258
00:20:24,869 --> 00:20:27,956
I am Kozuki Oden, also known as Yamato!
'Tis an honor to meet you!

259
00:20:29,478 --> 00:20:31,043
What?!

260
00:20:31,086 --> 00:20:33,216
"Joining you on your vessel"?!

261
00:20:33,217 --> 00:20:34,434
Mm-hmm!

262
00:20:36,043 --> 00:20:37,912
I'm all for it!

263
00:20:38,478 --> 00:20:40,217
I'm especially for it!

264
00:20:41,260 --> 00:20:42,782
What a funny boy.

265
00:20:42,782 --> 00:20:48,043
But I'm afraid that decision falls on the captain.
We cannot accept you unless he says yes.

266
00:20:48,043 --> 00:20:49,434
That is true.

267
00:20:57,565 --> 00:21:00,260
I only hope that Luffy
will make it through.

268
00:21:05,478 --> 00:21:09,304
I got shivers watching his fight...

269
00:21:09,304 --> 00:21:10,956
Witnessing his glorious visage!

270
00:21:10,957 --> 00:21:15,130
It was like, whack, bam, ka-boom!

271
00:21:15,130 --> 00:21:16,608
Oh, it was breathtaking!

272
00:21:20,739 --> 00:21:22,652
Hey, let's split!

273
00:21:22,652 --> 00:21:24,435
Yeah, it ain't safe here!

274
00:21:24,435 --> 00:21:28,130
They'll pay us back, an eye for an eye!

275
00:21:28,652 --> 00:21:30,130
Hey, stop!

276
00:21:35,086 --> 00:21:39,086
Who, exactly, gave you
permission to leave?!

277
00:21:39,086 --> 00:21:41,782
We don't wanna be slaves,
Young Master Yamato!

278
00:21:41,782 --> 00:21:43,652
Halt, lest I pummel you into the ground!

279
00:21:43,739 --> 00:21:47,000
Flight?!
That is a disgraceful act for a soldier!

280
00:21:47,000 --> 00:21:49,608
Shut yer traps and stay here, grunts!

281
00:21:49,608 --> 00:21:51,565
Or face my wrath!

282
00:21:51,565 --> 00:21:54,608
He doesn't seem like an enemy,
that's for sure.

283
00:21:54,608 --> 00:21:57,521
Say, what happens with those guys now?

284
00:21:57,521 --> 00:22:01,651
My technique'll wear off once
the moon comes back 'round.

285
00:22:01,652 --> 00:22:03,521
You mean, in a month?

286
00:22:03,521 --> 00:22:04,651
Yup.

287
00:22:05,608 --> 00:22:09,434
After a month, some o' the animals
go back to how they was before,

288
00:22:10,696 --> 00:22:13,043
but some of 'em stay friends with me.

289
00:22:13,043 --> 00:22:14,434
I see.

290
00:22:14,435 --> 00:22:16,391
I suppose it depends
on their personality?

291
00:22:16,391 --> 00:22:20,087
I bet they choose whichever
feels better to 'em.

292
00:22:20,913 --> 00:22:22,609
Neigh!

293
00:22:23,260 --> 00:22:24,738
Master!

294
00:22:25,521 --> 00:22:29,043
I'm so much happier with you!

295
00:22:29,043 --> 00:22:30,869
Horselina-chan...

296
00:22:31,608 --> 00:22:34,521
I hope ya stay with me too.

297
00:22:36,130 --> 00:22:38,391
But I dun want a servant.

298
00:22:38,957 --> 00:22:43,130
I want ya to stay with me
an' be my mommy!

299
00:22:47,435 --> 00:22:48,956
Horselina-chan!

300
00:22:55,000 --> 00:22:58,565
Oh, Master... Thank you so much.

301
00:22:59,391 --> 00:23:03,130
I'm so happy...

302
00:23:03,130 --> 00:23:07,043
Horselina-chan!
You're holding me a li'l too tight!

303
00:23:10,000 --> 00:23:13,391
Tama and Horselina...
I'm happy for them...

304
00:23:13,391 --> 00:23:14,261
Yeah.

305
00:23:27,130 --> 00:23:28,565
L-Look!

306
00:23:28,565 --> 00:23:31,478
Komurasaki, Kin-san, and all the rest
are on their knees!

307
00:23:41,000 --> 00:23:42,783
Who is that?

308
00:23:52,435 --> 00:23:53,565
Twenty years have passed...

309
00:23:54,957 --> 00:23:57,826
Since the passing of my father,
Kozuki Oden!

310
00:23:57,826 --> 00:23:59,217
Father?!

311
00:23:59,217 --> 00:24:00,913
DDon't tell me...

312
00:24:02,043 --> 00:24:04,303
Though these years have
surely worn on you,

313
00:24:04,304 --> 00:24:06,260
you have done well to persevere!

314
00:24:07,217 --> 00:24:08,652
The Fire Festival shall not end!

315
00:24:09,217 --> 00:24:12,304
Starting tomorrow,
you may do whatever business you please!

316
00:24:12,304 --> 00:24:14,217
What?! But Orochi will...

317
00:24:14,608 --> 00:24:16,478
You can drink all you want, too!

318
00:24:16,478 --> 00:24:17,435
What?!

319
00:24:17,869 --> 00:24:19,956
No longer shall you be charged
for well water!

320
00:24:21,521 --> 00:24:24,217
No longer shall the factories
release toxins that parch the soil!

321
00:24:25,043 --> 00:24:27,434
The Land of Wano is no place for slavery!

322
00:24:29,739 --> 00:24:31,913
Momo... kun?

323
00:24:31,913 --> 00:24:35,652
You need not suffer any longer.

324
00:24:45,957 --> 00:24:49,043
Four more died at the factory today...

325
00:24:49,043 --> 00:24:50,695
Maybe that will be me tomorrow...

326
00:25:07,000 --> 00:25:09,783
Who's gonna break it to O-Tama-chan?

327
00:25:12,000 --> 00:25:15,652
O-Tama-chan, I hate to tell you, but...

328
00:25:15,652 --> 00:25:18,739
...your father and mother are...

329
00:25:31,869 --> 00:25:33,999
Daddy... Mommy...

330
00:25:34,391 --> 00:25:36,521
Rest in peace.

331
00:25:36,521 --> 00:25:38,608
I'm gonna be just fine!

332
00:25:42,000 --> 00:25:44,130
That tickles!

333
00:25:47,086 --> 00:25:49,086
Woven hats for sale!

334
00:25:49,478 --> 00:25:52,174
Does anybody need a hat!!

335
00:25:52,174 --> 00:25:55,826
They's sturdy and'll last ya for ages!
It's a real steal!

336
00:25:56,174 --> 00:25:57,913
D'ya want a hat?

337
00:25:57,913 --> 00:26:00,391
Sorry, I don't have money.

338
00:26:02,304 --> 00:26:04,521
Hats for sale!

339
00:26:04,565 --> 00:26:06,825
Anybody want a hat?

340
00:26:15,260 --> 00:26:18,304
Komachiyo, I'm sorry.

341
00:26:18,304 --> 00:26:21,347
Couldn't sell a single hat...

342
00:26:39,521 --> 00:26:42,217
May I have a hat?

343
00:26:45,565 --> 00:26:48,695
T-Tengu-sama?!

344
00:26:53,174 --> 00:26:55,087
You're an orphan?

345
00:26:56,435 --> 00:26:58,217
Don't give up hope.

346
00:27:01,000 --> 00:27:02,478
Just a few years more...

347
00:27:02,478 --> 00:27:06,695
The mighty samurai, the Kozuki,
shall return to our land,

348
00:27:06,696 --> 00:27:10,609
and when that day comes,
they shall vanquish the ogres once and for all!

349
00:27:12,565 --> 00:27:13,651
Kozuki?

350
00:27:14,347 --> 00:27:15,608
Indeed.

351
00:27:21,391 --> 00:27:23,130
I'll keep goin'!

352
00:27:28,696 --> 00:27:32,000
I'm sure the Kozuki'll
kick those ogres' butts!

353
00:27:32,000 --> 00:27:36,217
So I ain't gonna give up!
I'll be fine!

354
00:27:41,000 --> 00:27:42,261
O-Tama?

355
00:27:42,957 --> 00:27:44,391
Master?

356
00:27:49,696 --> 00:27:50,522
Tama!

357
00:27:51,260 --> 00:27:53,347
We'll make it so this is normal!

358
00:27:53,347 --> 00:27:56,304
By the time we're outta this country,

359
00:27:56,347 --> 00:28:00,173
it'll be a place where
-you can eat all ya want!

360
00:28:13,391 --> 00:28:15,130
The wicked rule of Orochi...

361
00:28:15,130 --> 00:28:18,521
...and the days spent cowering in fear of Kaido
have now come to an end!

362
00:28:27,608 --> 00:28:30,521
I crossed the ocean and met
strong, faithful compatriots!

363
00:28:30,521 --> 00:28:36,304
Alongside the Ninja-Pirate-Mink-Samurai Alliance,
I led a raid upon Onigashima!

364
00:28:36,304 --> 00:28:39,912
Kaido, Orochi, and the
Animal Kingdom Pirates!

365
00:28:39,913 --> 00:28:42,478
Every evil that plagues our fair land...

366
00:28:44,217 --> 00:28:47,260
...has been vanquished!

367
00:28:47,260 --> 00:28:50,825
Whaaaaat?!

368
00:28:50,826 --> 00:28:53,956
Y-You-slew those monsters?!

369
00:28:53,957 --> 00:28:56,435
That awful Orochi is gone?!

370
00:28:57,608 --> 00:28:59,651
The what alliance...?!

371
00:29:04,304 --> 00:29:07,304
I don't need to be afraid anymore?

372
00:29:07,304 --> 00:29:08,043
Yeah...

373
00:29:08,086 --> 00:29:10,260
Fresh water to drink!

374
00:29:10,260 --> 00:29:13,782
I don't have to live through
that hell anymore...?

375
00:29:13,782 --> 00:29:16,347
Finally... Finally...

376
00:29:20,521 --> 00:29:25,825
And we will never forget all the brave souls
whose sacrifices paved the way for our raid!

377
00:29:53,739 --> 00:29:56,565
Kin'emon, what do I do now?

378
00:29:56,565 --> 00:29:58,695
I know not what else to say!

379
00:30:00,957 --> 00:30:03,130
Just show off a little!

380
00:30:04,086 --> 00:30:07,434
Are you just a puppet, Momo?!

381
00:30:07,435 --> 00:30:10,217
There anything left in the world
for ya to be scared of?!

382
00:30:13,652 --> 00:30:14,522
Th-

383
00:30:15,130 --> 00:30:17,478
The name my father bestowed upon me...

384
00:30:17,478 --> 00:30:19,391
...means "one without peer"!

385
00:30:20,739 --> 00:30:26,217
Under my rule, even our parched, desolate land
shall surely turn to a paradise!

386
00:30:26,565 --> 00:30:29,565
ask that you join me
in making that promise a reality!

387
00:30:30,608 --> 00:30:32,391
Having crossed twenty years,

388
00:30:32,739 --> 00:30:35,087
I have arrived to save you all!

389
00:30:37,608 --> 00:30:39,173
As of this day...

390
00:30:41,435 --> 00:30:45,391
I, Kozuki Momonosuke,
shall lead the Land of Wano!

391
00:31:02,565 --> 00:31:04,130
Momonosuke-sama!

392
00:31:04,217 --> 00:31:06,652
Oh, Momonosuke-sama!

393
00:31:25,739 --> 00:31:26,739
Mother!

394
00:31:27,565 --> 00:31:29,521
I shall remain true to my word!

395
00:31:32,086 --> 00:31:33,086
Father!

396
00:31:35,217 --> 00:31:37,826
I shall follow in your footsteps!

397
00:31:49,000 --> 00:31:51,130
Momonosuke-sama!

398
00:32:04,000 --> 00:32:07,696
The true shogunate has returned!

399
00:32:07,696 --> 00:32:10,956
We've waited for so long!

400
00:32:10,957 --> 00:32:13,652
Momonosuke-sama!

401
00:32:17,782 --> 00:32:21,739
As a proud warrior sheathes his blade,
cherry blossom petals flutter...

402
00:32:21,739 --> 00:32:24,869
...into the skies of that promised day.

403
00:32:24,869 --> 00:32:27,739
This is the proud Land of Samurai.

404
00:32:28,304 --> 00:32:31,738
Here under the night blossoms stands
a handsome man of eight!

405
00:32:33,000 --> 00:32:35,391
Blessed with great
dedication and mercy,

406
00:32:35,478 --> 00:32:39,000
albeit with strength that
leaves a little something to be desired.

407
00:32:45,696 --> 00:32:49,782
This is the birth of the man who
would later be known around the world...

408
00:32:50,739 --> 00:32:55,739
...as the Great Shogun of Wano,
Kozuki Momonosuke!

409
00:33:21,521 --> 00:33:24,173
"Time's up'

410
00:33:25,608 --> 00:33:28,999
Someone said again, with a laugh

411
00:33:29,521 --> 00:33:33,999
Fine then, hide-and-seek playtime...

412
00:33:34,739 --> 00:33:35,739
...is over

413
00:33:37,521 --> 00:33:40,782
Let's go, come on (We can see it soon)

414
00:33:40,957 --> 00:33:44,696
Let your heart beat out

415
00:33:45,652 --> 00:33:49,087
and things will change (We can see it soon)

416
00:33:49,217 --> 00:33:53,217
Grow strong, you have time

417
00:33:53,478 --> 00:33:54,217
Lift up that dream

418
00:33:54,347 --> 00:34:01,217
The overflowing loneliness can't sustain me alone

419
00:34:01,347 --> 00:34:05,217
We were so free in our younger days

420
00:34:05,304 --> 00:34:08,739
What a dumb dream

421
00:34:08,869 --> 00:34:09,869
...to live

422
00:34:09,957 --> 00:34:10,086
Shining a light on uncharte

423
00:34:10,086 --> 00:34:13,869
Shining a light on uncharted ways

424
00:34:14,000 --> 00:34:17,826
Get on our feet and try

425
00:34:18,086 --> 00:34:21,869
Let's see the ends of the world together

426
00:34:22,000 --> 00:34:30,001
Together, we can go and fly